      ],
      "description": "[qodo] FactRow is a frozen dataclass but contains mutable dict fields (snippets, enclosing). While the code comments state they're never mutated after construction, frozen dataclasses with mutable fields break immutability guarantees and make instances unhashable. Consider using MappingProxyType or making the class non-frozen.",
      "error": null,
      "anchor": null,
